# Commercially-licensed font faces — NOT redistributable via this repo.
#
# Joe Hand is licensed for web embedding (JOEBOB graphics Webfont EULA 1.0, licence owner
# Southern Destinations), but §1.5 forbids direct download/hotlinking and §1.6 forbids
# transfer or sublicensing — and a repository is a distribution channel. So the face is
# delivered by the build/deploy pipeline rather than committed. This is about
# redistribution, not doubt: the rights themselves are confirmed. → assets/fonts/LICENCES.md
#
# ⚠️ A fresh clone has 1 unresolved @font-face rule until the pipeline supplies the file.
# The `accent` family falls back to La Belle Aurore (bundled) and then cursive — degraded,
# not broken.
#
# ⚠️ These patterns do not remove the files already in git history. If this repo is ever
# public again, history needs rewriting. See CHANGELOG.md → Security.
#
# No Optima face is registered or bundled: the three previously here were unlicensed and
# were removed 2026-08-18. The optima-* pattern is kept so a stray conversion cannot be
# committed by accident while the self-hosting kit is outstanding. → LS-2641
#
# The OFL/Apache faces (Open Sans, Belleza, La Belle Aurore) are committed and safe to ship.
assets/fonts/optima-*.woff2
assets/fonts/joe-hand-*.woff2

# Test artefacts
tests/**/test-results/
tests/**/playwright-report/
tests/**/node_modules/
